# Dropbear SSH Configuration for WDMCH Rescue

# Root public-key authentication ONLY
# No password authentication is configured
# The authorized_keys file is injected at build time

# To add your SSH public key:
# 1. Place your public key in: /root/.ssh/authorized_keys
# 2. Ensure permissions: chmod 700 /root/.ssh && chmod 600 /root/.ssh/authorized_keys
# 3. Do NOT put a private key on the NAS

# WARNING: Root login via password is disabled by design.
# Only the injected public key can authenticate.
